			"notes": "## Fixed \n  \n  - **Zebras now drop Zebra Hide** (0–2 per kill, more with Looting). The item already\n    existed and its tooltip promised \"Dropped by Zebras\", but nothing in the game actually\n    produced it — it was creative-only until now. This is what makes the boots craftable\n    in survival.\n  - **Dik-diks can breed.** They previously refused every food item and could never produce\n    a fawn. They now accept wheat and corn, follow you while you hold either, and their                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \n    fawns inherit a parent's coat pattern instead of always spawning as the default variant.                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \n  - **Breeding now takes priority over following food.** Tempt goals shared a priority level                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \n    with the breed goal, and equal priority can't preempt — so holding the breeding item kept                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n    a fed pair trailing you around instead of pairing off. Now matches vanilla's ordering.                                                                                                                                                                                                                         \n    Affected **dik-diks, gemsboks, zebras, rhinos, zazus, giraffes and flamingos**.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \n  ## What's Changed                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \n  * Port Zebra Boots from the old mod by @ron1196 in https://github.com/ron1196/circle-of-craft/pull/103                                                                                                                                                                                                           \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \n  **Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ron1196/circle-of-craft/compare/v0.2.0-mc1.21.1...v0.3.0-mc1.21.1"
		}
	],
